{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"workshop_t1","model_identifier":"workshop_t1","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# workshop_t1\n\nWork Hut (workshop tier 1): a log hut with a chopping block and a stone-crushing quern (hand mill) whose upper stone turns.\n\n- Footprint: 7 x 6 columns (112 x 96 units, 3.15 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -44..50, y 0..99, z -40..50 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 50, construction_0 26, construction_33 31, construction_66 43, ruined 27 (7 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hut: 72 x 100 x 60 centred at x -4, z 14\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `workshop_t1_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `workshop_t1_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_workshop_t1` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 2.0 | loop | `quern_stone` turns (one turn per 2 s). |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-4, 0, -25)\n- `slot_work` at (-30, 0, -46)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (10, 0, -30)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"hut_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-42.0,0.0,-18.0],"to":[34.0,3.0,46.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,273.0,76.0,276.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[65.0,279.0,129.0,282.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,273.0,76.0,276.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[65.0,279.0,129.0,282.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[65.0,109.0,141.0,173.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[65.0,109.0,141.0,173.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0812e4ca-f848-52ec-ad2f-9b6020a3852c"},{"name":"hut_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-40.0,3.0,-16.0],"to":[32.0,53.0,-12.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[149.0,109.0,221.0,159.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[76.0,181.0,80.0,231.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[149.0,109.0,221.0,159.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[76.0,181.0,80.0,231.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[74.0,252.0,146.0,256.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[74.0,252.0,146.0,256.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"11c400ad-eea5-531b-afc9-e37be0d20b07"},{"name":"hut_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-40.0,3.0,40.0],"to":[32.0,53.0,44.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[149.0,109.0,221.0,159.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[80.0,181.0,84.0,231.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[149.0,109.0,221.0,159.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[80.0,181.0,84.0,231.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[146.0,252.0,218.0,256.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[146.0,252.0,218.0,256.0],