e":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"152d8278-87f5-53a1-b5ca-aa0235166010","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":90.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"2c2ea3d7-d754-5e2c-a81d-ec80d292fbcc","time":0.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":180.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"8307a994-bef2-5729-a802-7220d6b1d3b2","time":1,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":270.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"1bbd8ab0-32df-5570-a8e9-cbac0546efa0","time":1.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":360.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"0e671341-3bfc-51fc-9521-040ad46b02d1","time":2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"}]}}}],"description":"# workshop_t1\n\nWork Hut (workshop tier 1): a log hut with a chopping block and a stone-crushing quern (hand mill) whose upper stone turns.\n\n- Footprint: 7 x 6 columns (112 x 96 units, 3.15 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -44..50, y 0..99, z -40..50 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 50, construction_0 26, construction_33 31, construction_66 43, ruined 27 (7 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hut: 72 x 100 x 60 centred at x -4, z 14\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `workshop_t1_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `workshop_t1_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_workshop_t1` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 2.0 | loop | `quern_stone` turns (one turn per 2 s). |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-4, 0, -25)\n- `slot_work` at (-30, 0, -46)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (10, 0, -30)\n"}